---
import puzzles from '../data/puzzles.json';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout description={`Meet Large Print Crosswords, an independent collection of ${puzzles.length} free themed mini puzzles made for older adults and anyone who prefers larger letters.`} title="About — Large Print Crosswords"><div class="container prose"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE SIMPLE JOY OF A GOOD PUZZLE</p><h1>A little space to enjoy yourself.</h1></header><p>Large Print Crosswords is an independent collection of free, easy themed crosswords, designed with older adults and anyone who prefers larger letters in mind.</p><p>We believe a puzzle should feel welcoming. That means clear clues, readable type, no timer, and no account standing between you and your next word.</p><h2>Familiar things, fresh little challenges</h2><p>Our collection brings together {puzzles.length} mini crosswords across {new Set(puzzles.map(p=>p.series)).size} familiar series: gardens, home cooking, birds, books, travel, and more. Puzzles in the same series share a theme and may reuse familiar vocabulary, but each has its own grid and answer selection.</p><p>Our original word banks and clues are arranged into connected grids by a puzzle-building script. Every build checks crossing letters, numbering, connectivity, and duplicate layouts. Automated checks cannot guarantee that every clue feels equally easy to every player.</p><h2>For your favorite chair or your kitchen table</h2><p>Play online with optional hints, or print a copy with a separate answer sheet. Families, libraries, and community groups are welcome to print our puzzles for noncommercial activities. Republishing or selling the collection is not included in this permission.</p><h2>An independent puzzle site</h2><p>We are not affiliated with AARP or any newspaper puzzle publisher. Our puzzles are for entertainment; we do not make medical claims about memory or cognitive health.</p><a class="button" href="/crosswords/">Explore the collection →</a></div></Layout>
